- Card flip animation: 3D rotate on reveal, toggle in Study header
  (nemesis.study.flip), honors prefers-reduced-motion; plain reveal path kept
- Review surface polish: session progress bar, QUESTION/ANSWER labels, card tags,
  larger typography, rounded card — FSRS interval hints unchanged
- Match game (Quizlet-style): tap term then its match, wrong pairs shake, matched
  pairs fade, timer + win state, 'Play again'; launched from every deck card/row
  and the card browser (needs >=2 cards)
- CSS: nemesis-flip 3D transform + nemesis-shake keyframes, reduced-motion guard
